  "assets": [
    {
      "uuid": "effcfd50-56bb-4964-8ffc-fd5056bb1964",
      "name": "Getting Started.md",
      "path": "Assets/Tutorials/Getting Started.md",
      "assetType": "other",
      "mimeType": "text/markdown",
      "byteLength": 1238,
      "source": "---\ndismissible: true\ntemplate: platformer\n---\n# Welcome to Nova 26.17 Platforms and materials\n\nThis project was created from the **platformer** template. Open the Scene, Assets, Script, Debug, and Manage workspaces to explore the configured systems. Dismiss this tutorial from its Asset Inspector when you are ready.\n\n## Controls and setup (en)\n\nPlay: A/D to move, Space to jump. Click the Game viewport before using keys.\n\n### Expected result\n\nThe player moves and jumps on the ground/platform; an included sprite, idle clip, tile map and jump sound are attached.\n\nRequirements: Ready offline · Keyboard · Audio included\n\n## Steuerung und Einrichtung (de)\n\nPlay: A/D zum Bewegen, Leertaste zum Springen. Vor Tastatureingaben in die Spielansicht klicken.\n\n### Erwartetes Ergebnis\n\nDie Figur läuft und springt auf Boden/Plattform; Sprite, Idle-Clip, Tilemap und Sprungton sind enthalten.\n\nVoraussetzungen: Offline bereit · Tastatur · Audio enthalten\n\n## 操作与准备 (zh)\n\n播放后用 A/D 移动、空格跳跃；先点击游戏视口再按键。\n\n### 预期结果\n\n玩家可在地面和平台上移动跳跃；已绑定精灵、待机动画、瓦片地图和跳跃音效。\n\n使用要求: 离线可用 · 键盘 · 包含音频\n",
      "sourceModified": 0,
      "importedAt": 0,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "duration": 0,
      "fontFamily": "",
      "settings": {
        "filterMode": "Linear",
        "compression": "Lossless",
        "pixelsPerUnit": 100,
        "spriteRegion": null,
        "pivot": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.5
        },
        "atlas": false
      },
      "pipeline": {
        "importerVersion": "template-4.2",
        "platform": "web",
        "sourceHash": "9dacbdae97a93c013a84364de61aa4804489db9b9fd9afabd274e4ee28a53c3b",
        "artifactHash": "9dacbdae97a93c013a84364de61aa4804489db9b9fd9afabd274e4ee28a53c3b",
        "contentHash": "9dacbdae97a93c013a84364de61aa4804489db9b9fd9afabd274e4ee28a53c3b",
        "cacheKey": "9dacbdae97a93c013a84364de61aa4804489db9b9fd9afabd274e4ee28a53c3b",
        "status": "ready",
        "lastValidSource": "---\ndismissible: true\ntemplate: platformer\n---\n# Welcome to Nova 26.17 Platforms and materials\n\nThis project was created from the **platformer** template. Open the Scene, Assets, Script, Debug, and Manage workspaces to explore the configured systems. Dismiss this tutorial from its Asset Inspector when you are ready.\n\n## Controls and setup (en)\n\nPlay: A/D to move, Space to jump. Click the Game viewport before using keys.\n\n### Expected result\n\nThe player moves and jumps on the ground/platform; an included sprite, idle clip, tile map and jump sound are attached.\n\nRequirements: Ready offline · Keyboard · Audio included\n\n## Steuerung und Einrichtung (de)\n\nPlay: A/D zum Bewegen, Leertaste zum Springen. Vor Tastatureingaben in die Spielansicht klicken.\n\n### Erwartetes Ergebnis\n\nDie Figur läuft und springt auf Boden/Plattform; Sprite, Idle-Clip, Tilemap und Sprungton sind enthalten.\n\nVoraussetzungen: Offline bereit · Tastatur · Audio enthalten\n\n## 操作与准备 (zh)\n\n播放后用 A/D 移动、空格跳跃；先点击游戏视口再按键。\n\n### 预期结果\n\n玩家可在地面和平台上移动跳跃；已绑定精灵、待机动画、瓦片地图和跳跃音效。\n\n使用要求: 离线可用 · 键盘 · 包含音频\n",
        "error": "",
        "dependencies": [],
        "reverseDependencies": [],
        "cacheHit": false
      }
    },
    {
      "uuid": "f239103a-24ff-4666-8239-103a24ff5666",
      "name": "PlayerController.rhai",
      "path": "Assets/Scripts/PlayerController.rhai",
      "assetType": "script",
      "mimeType": "text/x-rhai",
      "byteLength": 1040,
      "source": "@export(type=\"float\", min=0, max=30, step=0.1, group=\"Movement\", tooltip=\"Horizontal speed in world units per second\") let speed = 8.0;\n@export(type=\"float\", min=-100, max=0, step=0.1, group=\"Movement\", tooltip=\"Vertical acceleration\") let gravity = -22.0;\n@export(type=\"float\", min=0, max=50, step=0.1, group=\"Movement\", tooltip=\"Jump speed\") let jump_speed = 12.0;\nfn fixed_update(dt) {\n  let move = input_axis(\"MoveHorizontal\");\n  let vertical = rigid_body().velocity_y + gravity * dt;\n  if input_pressed(\"Jump\") && can_coyote_jump() { vertical = jump_speed; audio_play(); }\n  move_character(move * speed * dt, vertical * dt);\n}\n@export(type=\"float\", min=0, max=1, step=0.01, group=\"Readout\") let readout_elapsed = 0.0;\nfn update(dt) {\n  readout_elapsed += dt;\n  if readout_elapsed < 0.1 { return; }\n  readout_elapsed = 0.0;\n  let pose = transform();\n  let x = (pose.position_x * 1000.0).round() / 1000.0;\n  let y = (pose.position_y * 1000.0).round() / 1000.0;\n  ui_set_text_on(find_entity_handle(\"Physics Readout\"), `X ${x} Y ${y}`);\n}\n",
      "sourceModified": 0,
      "importedAt": 0,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "duration": 0,
      "fontFamily": "",
      "settings": {
        "filterMode": "Linear",
        "compression": "Lossless",
        "pixelsPerUnit": 100,
        "spriteRegion": null,
        "pivot": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.5
        },
        "atlas": false
      },
